      "description": "Monthly sales with 3- and 6-month moving averages computed in the spec (window transform). Up to 24 months. Autor: Cristobal Salcedo Beltrán.",
      "author": "Cristobal Salcedo Beltrán",
      "uuid": "7e69cf61-558c-4feb-a738-466048eb1e65",
